{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝（Jamieson Vitamin C 1,000 mg Timed Release）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、莎莎、HKTVmall、Market Place及龍豐共6間零售商的網店報價。以同款單瓶標價計，最低與次低相差HK$59，約30%。</p>\n<h2>增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜莎莎</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$139</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$139</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單瓶標價，網店限定，平行進口</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>龍豐</td>\n<td>HK$198</td>\n<td>HK$198</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝單瓶價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一瓶增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝，莎莎的同款網上標價為HK$139，較表列次低標價HK$198少HK$59。莎莎標示為網店限定及平行進口，本次用網店標價比較。</p>\n<p>莎莎列為網店限定及平行進口，送上門滿HK$300免運費；單瓶未達此門檻。萬寧另列JAM10優惠碼，表內單瓶標價未扣優惠碼。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月24日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E9%95%B7%E6%95%88%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDc1000%E6%AF%AB%E5%85%8B-100%E7%B2%92/p/BP_297042\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/jamieson-timed-release-vitamin-c-1000mg-100pcs/p/096651\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.sasa.com.hk/SalePage/Index/303253\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">莎莎</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/Jamieson-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/H6754005/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD/%E9%95%B7%E6%95%88%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDC1000%E6%AF%AB%E5%85%8B-100%E7%B2%92/p/H6754005_S_H3281322125\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDC%20TR%201000%20100s/i/116575586.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn190328/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款產品的標籤列維他命C。維他命C有助人體合成膠原蛋白，亦有助吸收植物性食物中的非血紅素鐵。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminC-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH：維他命C資料</a></p>\n<p>本次以（HK$198－HK$139）÷HK$198×100%計，約30%。計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179546124652718308_17549423286b04907f11e49.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝格價\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179546124652718308_17549423286b04907f11e49.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月24日網上報價，莎莎的單瓶商品總額為HK$139。條件為單瓶標價，網店限定，平行進口，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次針對長效1000毫克、100粒瓶裝。莎莎將所售版本列為網店限定及平行進口，落單前宜核對標籤、包裝和取貨條件。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T19:40:13.180676+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":977,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:14:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T22:56:01.177259+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T19:33:40.027351+00:00","content_hash":"d40ab08af489fab187add275ebb36d7ca4ff79275eed14aafc3ead03dc0d2531","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}